  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP SDG Innovation Pilot Project on Youth Innovation and Entrepreneurship</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The core objective of the project is to bring together the diverse stakeholders to discuss youth realities, trends and prospects while sharing knowledge and experiences, and build a robust, scalable national platform for youth leadership, innovation and entrepreneurship. It will focus on strengthening SDG and entrepreneurship education, cultivating 21st-century skills, and empowering Chinese young talents to become proactive leaders and change-makers within the global sustainable development age</narrative>
  </description>
